@word gewunnt = lived
@word gehat = had
@word midd = tired
@word d'Stad = the city
@word d'Persoun = the person
@word de Kolleeg = the flatmate
@word d'Rei = the turn
@word d'Traditioun = the tradition
@word d'Zukunft = the future
@word d'Kontroll = control
@word de Stress = stress
@word d'Rou = calm
@word den Elektriker = the electrician
@word den Installateur = the plumber
