# --- The parents' household: the real exam's opening cluster ---

@sentence
@question Firwat hutt Dir dat Theema gewielt?
@lu Ech hunn dat Theema gewielt, well ech vun alldeegleche Saache schwätze wollt.
@distractor-lu Aarbecht
@distractor-lu Musek
@en I chose this topic because I wanted to talk about everyday things.
@distractor-en work
@distractor-en music

@sentence
@question Wéi laang hutt Dir mat Ären Eltere gewunnt?
@lu Ech hu bis siwwenzéng Joer mat mengen Eltere gewunnt.
@distractor-lu Kanner
@distractor-lu eleng
@en I lived with my parents until seventeen years of age.
@distractor-en children
@distractor-en alone

@sentence
@question Wéini sidd Dir doheem erausgeplënnert?
@lu Ech si mat siwwenzéng Joer erausgeplënnert, well ech op der Universitéit studéiert hunn.
@distractor-lu geschafft
@distractor-lu Aarbecht
@en I moved out at seventeen years of age because I studied at university.
@distractor-en worked
@distractor-en work

@sentence
@question Hutt Dir Ären Elteren am Stot gehollef?
@lu Jo, ech hunn hinne gehollef, mee net all Dag.
@distractor-lu Nee
@distractor-lu dacks
@en Yes, I helped them, but not every day.
@distractor-en No
@distractor-en often

@sentence
@question Wéi eng Aufgaben hutt Dir am Stot gemaach, a wéi eng hunn Är Eltere gemaach?
@lu Ech hu mäi Zëmmer gebotzt, a meng Eltere hunn de Rescht vun der Wunneng gemaach.
@distractor-lu Gaart
@distractor-lu Botzfra
@en I cleaned my room, and my parents did the rest of the apartment.
@distractor-en garden
@distractor-en cleaner

@sentence
@question Hutt Dir bei Ären Elteren och gekacht?
@lu Ech hunn heiansdo mat menger Mamm gekacht, mee ech hu ni eleng gekacht.
@distractor-lu ëmmer
@distractor-lu gebotzt
@en I sometimes cooked with my mother, but I never cooked alone.
@distractor-en always
@distractor-en cleaned

@sentence
@question Wéi eng Aufgaben hutt Dir gär gemaach?
@lu Ganz éierlech: ech hu keng Aufgab am Stot gär gemaach.
@distractor-lu alles
@distractor-lu kachen
@en Quite honestly: I did not like doing any task in the household.
@distractor-en everything
@distractor-en cooking

@sentence
@question Firwat hutt Dir de Stot deemools net gär gemaach?
@lu Ech hunn de Stot gemaach, well et néideg war, an net well et Spaass mécht.
@distractor-lu angeneem
@distractor-lu Hëllef
@en I did the household chores because it was necessary, and not because it is fun.
@distractor-en pleasant
@distractor-en help

