@distractor-lu Joer
@distractor-lu seelen
@en Three to four times a week I do something in the household.
@distractor-en year
@distractor-en rarely

# --- The cleaning lady: advantages and disadvantages ---

@sentence
@question Hutt Dir eng Botzfra? Wann nee, firwat net?
@lu Mir hu keng Botzfra méi, well mir no dem Plënneren nach keng gutt fonnt hunn.
@distractor-lu Jo
@distractor-lu Firma
@en We no longer have a cleaning lady, because after the move we have not yet found a good one.
@distractor-en Yes
@distractor-en company

@sentence
@question Hutt Dir fréier eng Botzfra gehat?
@lu Jo, an eiser aler Wunneng hate mir eng Botzfra.
@distractor-lu Handwierker
@distractor-lu ni
@en Yes, in our old apartment we had a cleaning lady.
@distractor-en workman
@distractor-en never

@sentence
@question Wat sinn d'Virdeeler vun enger Botzfra?
@lu De gréisste Virdeel ass, datt mir dann net botze mussen, well kee vun eis dat gär mécht.
@distractor-lu Nodeel
@distractor-lu bëlleg
@en The biggest advantage is that we then do not have to clean, because neither of us likes doing that.
@distractor-en disadvantage
@distractor-en cheap

@sentence
@question Wat sinn d'Nodeeler vun enger Botzfra?
@lu Eng Botzfra ass net bëlleg, dofir kënne mir se net all Woch bezuelen.
@distractor-lu Virdeel
@distractor-lu propper
@en A cleaning lady is not cheap, that is why we cannot pay her every week.
@distractor-en advantage
@distractor-en clean

@sentence
@question Wat huet Är Botzfra gemaach?
@lu Si huet gestaubsaugt, de Buedem gebotzt an d'Buedzëmmer propper gemaach.
@distractor-lu gekacht
@distractor-lu Gaart
@en She vacuumed, cleaned the floor and made the bathroom clean.
@distractor-en cooked
@distractor-en garden

@sentence
@question Sicht Dir eng nei Botzfra?
@lu Jo, mir sichen nach eng gutt Botzfra, mee bis dohinner botze mir selwer.
@distractor-lu Handwierker
@distractor-lu ni
@en Yes, we are still looking for a good cleaning lady, but until then we clean ourselves.
@distractor-en workman
@distractor-en never

# --- How cleaning feels ---

@sentence
@question Maacht Dir gär de Stot? Firwat oder firwat net?
@lu Ech maachen de Stot net gär, well et langweileg an ustrengend ass.
@distractor-lu angeneem
@distractor-lu spannend
@en I do not like doing the household chores, because it is boring and exhausting.
@distractor-en pleasant
@distractor-en exciting

@sentence
@question Wéi fillt Dir Iech, wann Dir gebotzt hutt?
@lu No dem Botzen sinn ech midd, mee eng propper Wunneng mécht de Kapp fräi.
@distractor-lu knaschteg
@distractor-lu Stëbs
@en After cleaning I am tired, but a clean apartment clears the head.
@distractor-en dirty
@distractor-en dust

@sentence
@question Wéi eng Hausaarbecht fannt Dir ustrengend? Firwat?
@lu Ech fannen de Buedem opbotzen a stëbsen ustrengend, well se lang daueren.
@distractor-lu angeneem
@distractor-lu séier
@en I find mopping the floor and dusting exhausting, because they take long.
@distractor-en pleasant
@distractor-en fast

@sentence
@question Wat ass Är Liblingshausaarbecht? Firwat?
@lu Ech raume gär Këschte mat ale Saachen op, well ech da vill ewechgeheien.
@distractor-lu stëbsen
@distractor-lu langweileg
@en I like tidying up boxes with old things, because I then throw a lot away.
@distractor-en dusting
@distractor-en boring

@sentence
@question Lauschtert Dir Musek, wann Dir de Stot maacht?
@lu Jo, ech lauschtere Musek oder e Podcast, mee net beim Staubsaugen.
@distractor-lu ëmmer
@distractor-lu Kopfhörer
@en Yes, I listen to music or a podcast, but not while vacuuming.
@distractor-en always
@distractor-en headphones

@sentence
@question Firwat lauschtert Dir beim Staubsaugen keng Musek?
@lu De Staubsauger mécht ze vill Kaméidi, dofir héieren ech déi Musek net.
@distractor-lu roueg
@distractor-lu Biesem
@en The vacuum cleaner makes too much noise, that is why I do not hear the music.
@distractor-en quiet
@distractor-en broom

